Phase 1 will populate this directory with:
  spmixw.sthlp         - master help (overview, common options, see-also)
  spmixw_ols.sthlp     - OLS-specific help

Stata help files use SMCL. Each .sthlp must include:
  - Title block, syntax, description
  - Options table
  - Worked example using simulate_panel data
  - References (LeSage; Debarsy & LeSage 2021)
  - Author / cite-as block
